              "type": "text",
              "cols": 2,
              "title": {
                "zh": "质量承诺",
                "en": "Quality Commitment"
              },
              "paras": [
                {
                  "zh": "每一批货附 MTC，成分按炉次出具，力学性能按验收标准抽样。客户对检测报告有疑问时，我们保留同炉余样供复检。",
                  "en": "Every shipment carries an MTC with heat-specific chemistry and sampled mechanical results. Retained coupons from the same heat are kept for re-testing."
                },
                {
                  "zh": "英制规格是我们的差异化能力：多数钢厂以公制为默认生产语言，稳定供应英制尺寸加冷轧表面，需要单独的排产与公差控制。",
                  "en": "Imperial sizing is our differentiator: most mills default to metric. Stable imperial supply with cold-rolled finish requires dedicated scheduling and tolerance control."
                },
                {
                  "zh": "文件不造假，不补签。报告怎么写，货就怎么交。这一条没有商量余地。",
                  "en": "No falsified or back-dated documents. The report matches the goods. This is not negotiable."
                }
              ],
              "pull": {
                "q": {
                  "zh": "客户买的不是公差，是确定感。",
                  "en": "What the customer buys is not tolerance — it is certainty."
                },
                "who": {
                  "zh": "内部质量口径",
                  "en": "Example quality policy"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
